From: cruz <jelon@tbu.net>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 16:34:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 004/206] port(3.12.2): declare
 Dart_DumpSnapshotInformationShorebirdAsJson (B2)

Upstream never touched this header between 3.7 and 3.12.2, so this is a clean
pick. Declaration only; the implementation lands with
analyze_snapshot_api_impl.cc.

Deliberately NOT ported from the 3.7 branch, per CLAUDE.md rule 1 (Route-A is
out of scope -- Shorebird does not do KBC dynamic modules):
  - dispatch_table.h SetEntryForCid          (Gate 1 V2 virtual-call spike)
  - dispatch_table_generator.cc selector skip (dyn-module TFA retention)
Carrying those over would move retired debt onto the new branch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/runtime/include/analyze_snapshot_api.h b/runtime/include/analyze_snapshot_api.h
index 38b58e0b340..daf616f5d09 100644
--- a/runtime/include/analyze_snapshot_api.h
+++ b/runtime/include/analyze_snapshot_api.h
@@ -24,6 +24,12 @@ void Dart_DumpSnapshotInformationAsJson(
     char** buffer,
     intptr_t* buffer_length);
 
+// flutter_hot_patcher B2: Shorebird-compatible output.
+void Dart_DumpSnapshotInformationShorebirdAsJson(
+    const Dart_SnapshotAnalyzerInformation& info,
+    char** out,
+    intptr_t* out_len);
+
 }  // namespace snapshot_analyzer
 }  // namespace dart
 
